```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "User Layer"
        USER[👤 User]
        CLAUDE[🤖 Claude Desktop]
        VSCODE[📝 VS Code]
        API[🔗 API Client]
    end

    subgraph "MCP Server"
        SERVER[🏗️ MCP Server]
        TOOL1[⚡ generate_jmeter_script]
        TOOL2[🐳 execute_jmeter_script]
        HANDLER[🎯 JMeter Handler]
    end

    subgraph "File System"
        JMX[📁 JMX Files]
        CSV[📊 CSV Data]
        RESULTS[📈 Results]
    end

    subgraph "Docker Engine"
        DOCKER[🐳 Docker]
        JMETER[⚙️ JMeter Runtime]
        VOLUMES[🔗 Volume Mounts]
    end

    subgraph "Analysis Engine"
        PARSER[📊 JTL Parser]
        ANALYZER[📈 Stats Analyzer]
        GENERATOR[📋 Report Generator]
    end

    subgraph "Report Outputs"
        HTML[🌐 HTML Report]
        MD[📝 Markdown]
        JSON[📊 JSON Data]
        DASHBOARD[📈 JMeter Dashboard]
    end

    subgraph "Test Targets"
        APPS[🎯 Web Apps & APIs]
    end

    %% Main Flow
    USER --> CLAUDE
    USER --> VSCODE
    USER --> API
    
    CLAUDE --> SERVER
    VSCODE --> SERVER
    API --> SERVER

    SERVER --> TOOL1
    SERVER --> TOOL2
    TOOL1 --> HANDLER
    TOOL2 --> HANDLER

    HANDLER --> JMX
    HANDLER --> CSV

    TOOL2 --> DOCKER
    DOCKER --> JMETER
    JMX -.-> VOLUMES
    CSV -.-> VOLUMES
    RESULTS -.-> VOLUMES

    JMETER --> APPS
    APPS --> JMETER
    JMETER --> RESULTS

    RESULTS --> PARSER
    PARSER --> ANALYZER
    ANALYZER --> GENERATOR

    GENERATOR --> HTML
    GENERATOR --> MD
    GENERATOR --> JSON
    JMETER --> DASHBOARD

    %% Styling
    classDef userLayer fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef serverLayer fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#1b5e20,stroke-width:2px
    classDef dockerLayer fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef analysisLayer fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#880e4f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef reportLayer fill:#f1f8e9,stroke:#33691e,stroke-width:2px
    classDef externalLayer fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#424242,stroke-width:2px

    class USER,CLAUDE,VSCODE,API userLayer
    class SERVER,TOOL1,TOOL2,HANDLER serverLayer
    class DOCKER,JMETER,VOLUMES dockerLayer
    class PARSER,ANALYZER,GENERATOR analysisLayer
    class HTML,MD,JSON,DASHBOARD reportLayer
    class APPS externalLayer
```

## Simplified Architecture

### 🏗️ Core Components

**User Layer** → **MCP Server** → **Docker Engine** → **Analysis Engine** → **Report Outputs**

### 🔄 Data Flow

1. **User Input** → MCP Tools → File Generation
2. **Docker Execution** → JMeter Runtime → Test Results  
3. **Analysis Pipeline** → Performance Reports

### 🚀 Key Features

- **Complete Automation**: Zero manual intervention
- **Multiple Formats**: HTML, Markdown, JSON reports
- **Docker Integration**: Containerized execution
- **Real-time Analysis**: Performance trend detection
```